        1899,
        1520,
        2163
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Effective March 30, 1995, or as soon as possible thereafter as a merger of the New York City Police Department and the New York City Transit Authority Police Department may be effectuated pursuant to the terms and conditions of a duly executed Memorandum of Understanding between the New York City Transit Authority and the City of New York, the New York City Police Department shall assume the functions of the Transit Authority Police Department, consistent with such terms and conditions.",
